<p> </p>
<p><span data-usefontface="true" data-contrast="none" class="TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0" lang="EN-US"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0">These urethane shock-absorbing wheels feature an integrated dampening mechanism that </span></span><span data-usefontface="true" data-contrast="none" class="TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0" lang="EN-US"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0">minimizes vibration and softens the feel of bumps and uneven terrain. From paved streets and </span></span><span data-usefontface="true" data-contrast="none" class="TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0" lang="EN-US"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0">textured walkways to tile and carpet, the wheels adapt to the environment to support a smoother, </span></span><span data-usefontface="true" data-contrast="none" class="TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0" lang="EN-US"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0">quieter experience with the Zeen. This enhanced design brings an added layer of comfort and </span></span><span data-usefontface="true" data-contrast="none" class="TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0" lang="EN-US"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0">control for users who want their Zeen to handle varied surfaces with greater ease.<br></span></span><br><span data-usefontface="true" data-contrast="none" class="TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0" lang="EN-US"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0">This kit includes all four wheels, the hardware and spacers necessary for use with them, and the tools needed to make the swap. See our <a href="https://vimeo.com/1154353097" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><span style="text-decoration: underline;">wheel swap video</span></a>.</span></span></p>
<p> </p>
<p><span data-usefontface="true" data-contrast="none" class="TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0" lang="EN-US"></span><span data-usefontface="true" data-contrast="none" class="TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0" lang="EN-US"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0"><span style="font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Aptos',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos; mso-ligatures: standardcontextual; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;">Note: Braking performance is reduced when using the Urethane Wheels in wet conditions. If you anticipate using the Zeen on wet surfaces and terrain with hills, we recommend using our standard Never-Flat Foam Wheels.</span></span></span></p></td>
